{%- when 'two' -%}<div class="rs rs-body rs-two"><section class="sec"><div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Before you <em>wrap it.</em></h2></div><div class="acc" style="padding-top:0"><details open><summary>How fast will it arrive?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Each drum ships within 2–3 days with free tracking and insurance. Expect it at your door in 5–10 business days.</div></details><details><summary>Are the bonuses included with every drum?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Yes. Each drum comes with its own kit: two mallet rests, guide book, mallets, finger picks, number stickers and travel bag.</div></details><details><summary>Can I send it straight to them?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Yes. Enter their address as the delivery address at checkout and we’ll ship it straight to them.</div></details><details><summary>Is it easy for older hands?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Yes. The notes are wide and numbered, and a light tap with the soft mallet or a fingertip is enough.</div></details><details><summary>I can't read music. Will I manage?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Yes. The guide book uses numbers, not notes, and every note is in the same scale, so nothing sounds wrong.</div></details><details><summary>Can it live outside?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">It's made to be played by the rain. Wipe it dry afterwards and bring it in for frost, snow and storms.</div></details><details><summary>Is it loud?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">No. It has a soft, bell-like tone you'll hear on the patio without it carrying down the street.</div></details><details><summary>What if they don't love it?<svg class="ic" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg></summary><div class="body">Return it within 30 days of delivery for a full refund of the item price. Email support@madespecial.store with your order number to start.</div></details></div></section><section class="final"><img src="{{ 'rainsong-under-tree.jpg' | file_img_url: '1000x' }}" width="1000" height="750" alt="Two gift boxes under a Christmas tree, one open with the drum inside" loading="lazy"><div class="in">
<p class="eyebrow" style="color:#D7B98A">Black Friday · This Christmas</p><h2>Give them the sound of <em>the rain.</em></h2><p>Up to <span data-f="maxoff">{{ rs_maxoff }}%</span> off, plus 6 free bonuses included with every drum. Free tracked shipping and 30 days to decide.</p>
<button type="button" class="atc" data-scroll="buy"><span>Pick Your Bundle</span><span class="num" data-f="from">From {{ rs_from | money }}</span></button></div></section>
<div class="sticky" id="sticky" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'rainsong-main-gift.jpg' | file_img_url: '120x' }}" alt="" width="48" height="48"><div class="s"><b><span class="num" id="stp">{ rs_unit | money }</span> · <span id="stn">1 drum</span></b><span class="bfx">Black Friday</span> · <span id="stk">6 bonuses included</span></div><button type="button" data-atc>Add to bag</button></div></div>
